GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "68A48802C1339258"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{26C888ACD54A23EF}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Summary"
     m_sContent "Captain Rod Boswell of the Royal Marines Mountain Arctic Warfare Cadre and 24 of his men screening ahead of the main British body pushing toward Port Stanley. have chosen to conduct an assault onto an Argentinian OP, which was spotted the previous night by their own OP, to destroy the occupying forces in order not to delay advancing friendly troops the next day."\
     ""\
     "RATIO: 1.4:1"
    }
    GC_Briefing "{2E51556F688102F0}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "DTL: 31/05/1982, 0530hr, Falkland Islands"\
     ""\
     "We're screening ahead of friendly forces pushing from the west, having several OP/LPs established throughout miles of terrain."\
     ""\
     "Last night, our OP observed an Argentine group occupy the secluded lodge known as Top Malo House."\
     "We've obvsersed them over night and concluded they are also establishing OP/LPs in an attempt to screen their own forces."\
     ""\
     "Captain Rod Boswell, our commanding officer, has chosen to strike early and conduct a deliberate assault onto the lodge so our friendly forces pushing through tomorrow will not be delayed or seen."\
     ""\
     "We've hitched a ride in a helicopter to our forming up point on the ground, we now need to move to our respected staging areas."\
     ""\
     "Let's go troops!"\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{61C15864A292A3A6}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "|PRELIMS|"\
     "DTL: 31/05/1982, 0530hr, Falkland Island, Top Malo House."\
     "Weather: Clear, no forecast of change."\
     ""\
     "|LOR|"\
     "We're screening ahead of our friendly forces due east of our location in the defence of port Stanley."\
     ""\
     "Last night we were dropped off by two helicopters at 2300hrs and have marched since then through awful spine chilling cold and wet weather until we reach our chosen OP at Top Malo House."\
     ""\
     "We've settled in and are now conducting routin."\
     "Let's get some reports!"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_ARG"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{FEF2C4C51597B672}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "MISSION STATEMENT:"\
     "Our troop will conduct as DELIBERATE ASSAULT onto the lodge known as Top Malo House, in order to SECURE it by DESTROYING the occupying enemy force."\
     ""\
     "EXECUTION:"\
     "1. Troop will use flag poles to TP insert to either of the marked locations."\
     "2. Troop will form up and stage their attack."\
     "3. Troop will begin the attack, follow by an assault onto the lodge itself."\
     "4. Troop's end state will see us formed up on the point of interest with all enemy killed, having secured it."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{4FACDB1C3E255A63}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "|MISSION STATEMENT|"\
     "Our mission is to establish an OP at Top Malo House in order for us to observe the British advance for the next 4 days and report any sighting."\
     ""\
     "|EXECUTION|"\
     "We've secured this location and our OP is setup."\
     "We should now go into routine and establish a perimeter with sentries and some of our charges/traps incase we're compromised, allowing the guys siting in the OP room to continue their job."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_ARG"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0B71B04A45F4A964}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "COMPOSITION AND DISPOSITION:"\
     "We are the Royal Marine Mountain and Arctic Warfare Cadre, consisting of 24x pax."\
     "We've landed by helicopter and now need to choose which AO insert(s) we want to stage our attack from."\
     ""\
     "At spawn after 4mins, you can teleport to either of the inserts by interacting with the flag poles."\
     ""\
     "STRENGTHS AND CAPABILITIES:"\
     "Moving quick to destroy this threat, we've broken down our OP, headed back to company and grabbed what we had available to us at short notice."\
     ""\
     "• We have 6x M72 disposable AT launchers across the troop."\
     "• Our MG team has roughly 700 rounds."\
     "• We have a sharpshooter with the Troop 2IC."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{282389EF4C3AEDF8}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "|COMPOSITION AND DISPOSITION|"\
     "We the 1st Assault section from the 602th Commando Company."\
     "Consisting of 13x pax, located at Top Malo House, GRID: 099025"\
     ""\
     "|STRENGTHS AND CAPABILITIES|"\
     "We've taken a beating from the elements trying to get here, we're all cold and tired."\
     ""\
     "Our section has extra supplies in the box, on the table inside the lodge ground floor."\
     "We have:"\
     "• 5x AP mines."\
     "• 7x demo charges, 3x detonators."\
     "• 4x extra FN-MAG belts, 10x FAL mags."\
     "• 3x HE and smoke grenades."\
     "• 9x Flares."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_ARG"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{834F2A1DED1B0D8A}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "COMPOSITION AND DISPOSITION:"\
     "Enemy forces appear to be an Argentine group of unknown origin, manning what looks to be an OP."\
     ""\
     "We don't know their precise number but can confirm atleast 10x pax, located at Top Malo House, GRID: 099025"\
     ""\
     "STRENGTHS AND CAPABILITIES:"\
     "Argentine forces are known to use very similar weapons and equipment to ourselves. We should be mindful of PID."\
     "Our uniforms are of similar cut and colour, the only difference is they wear solid green while we have DPM."\
     "Their helmets look similar also, so we've chosen to wear soft hats to better help PID."\
     ""\
     "They weaponry is once again very similar, using the FN FAL, FN MAG, Hi-powers, some American made weapons also like the CAR-15, M16, M14."\
     ""\
     "• Mine threat: Moderate - They may establish a perimeter around their OP with trip flare and mines."\
     "• IDF threat: None - We're out of range."\
     "• CAS threat: None - Highly unlikely it'll ever be here on time to do any effect by H-hour."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{67B4196B0E505F2C}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "|COMPOSITION AND DISPOSITION|"\
     "Enemy forces are the United Kingdom."\
     "The nearest known enemy force are 42Cdo located 11km away due west."\
     ""\
     "|STRENGTHS AND CAPABILITIES|"\
     "British forces have very similar weaponry and equipment to us."\
     "PID can be rather hard as our helmets and uniforms are coloured and cut the same, apart from we wear solid green, compared to their DPM camo pattern"\
     ""\
     "Their weaponry is once again very similar, using the L1A1, GPMG, Hi-powers, Sterlings some American made weapons also like the CAR-15, M16."\
     ""\
     "• Mine threat: None"\
     "• IDF threat: None - We're out of range."\
     "• CAS threat: Low - Most of the British air is tied up on the main effort."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_ARG"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{FD0F609436C57D33}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "Comsig"
     m_sContent "CALLSIGNS"\
     "Assault group - Alpha"\
     "Support group - Bravo"\
     ""\
     "CHANNELS AND FREQUENCYS"\
     "Platoon NET: 40hz"\
     ""\
     "PYROTECHNICS AND SIGNALS:"\
     "White smoke/flare - Maneuvers/Illuimnation"\
     "Green smoke/flare - Friendly location"\
     "Red smoke/flare - Enemy location"\
     "Purple smoke - Casualties"\
     ""\
     "PASSWORD:"\
     "Challenge - Cladded"\
     "Password-  Steel"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
